 opponent cleans you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/1d3b94e56951707dc06779c19388dac3.avif?t=1757682472\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/eaf028f67857034a1c1c33b67990f218.poster.avif?t=1757682472\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/eaf028f67857034a1c1c33b67990f218.gif?t=1757682472\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose the game, lose your life - get tossed overboard and replaced with a new poor soul, and start again. Another match lost is another notch on the body count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/9a991f4db26089268043905cc483fa14.avif?t=1757682472\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/545aee985302c3b5099a2c169e83fdff.poster.avif?t=1757682472\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/545aee985302c3b5099a2c169e83fdff.gif?t=1757682472\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to hide away your best resources in the hidden compartment of your cell for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/